---
interface Props { title: string; description: string }
const { title, description } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="thermal-comparison">
  <div class="thermal-comparison__shell">
    <header><span>Representación visual</span><h2>{title}</h2><p>{description}</p></header>
    <div class="thermal-comparison__chart" aria-label="Ejemplo visual de comportamiento térmico antes y después del servicio">
      <div class="thermal-comparison__column thermal-comparison__column--before">
        <div><span>Antes</span><strong>Calor inestable</strong></div>
        <ul><li><b style="--level: 94%"></b><span>CPU</span><strong>95°</strong></li><li><b style="--level: 88%"></b><span>GPU</span><strong>90°</strong></li><li><b style="--level: 82%"></b><span>Sistema</span><strong>88°</strong></li></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="thermal-comparison__axis"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i><span>Diagnóstico<br/>Limpieza<br/>Prueba</span></div>
      <div class="thermal-comparison__column thermal-comparison__column--after">
        <div><span>Después</span><strong>Respuesta más estable</strong></div>
        <ul><li><b style="--level: 68%"></b><span>CPU</span><strong>75°</strong></li><li><b style="--level: 61%"></b><span>GPU</span><strong>72°</strong></li><li><b style="--level: 56%"></b><span>Sistema</span><strong>70°</strong></li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <small>Las cifras son una representación gráfica. El resultado real depende del modelo, diseño térmico y estado de cada componente.</small>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .thermal-comparison { padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 116px) 0; color: #071f3a; background: #fff; }
  .thermal-comparison__shell { width: min(1100px, calc(100% - (var(--page-gutter) * 2))); margin: 0 auto; }
  .thermal-comparison header { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 0 42px; }
  .thermal-comparison header > span { color: #1672ca; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .thermal-comparison h2 { margin: 10px 0 16px; color: #071f3a; font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.1rem); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: 0; text-wrap: balance; }
  .thermal-comparison header p { max-width: 66ch; margin: 0; color: #24435f; line-height: 1.7; }
  .thermal-comparison__chart { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 110px 1fr; align-items: stretch; border: 1px solid #d6e1ea; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
  .thermal-comparison__column { padding: 30px; }
  .thermal-comparison__column > div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 34px; }
  .thermal-comparison__column > div span { color: #557086; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 850; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .thermal-comparison__column > div strong { color: #071f3a; }
  .thermal-comparison__column ul { display: grid; gap: 16px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .thermal-comparison__column li { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 7px; padding-top: 13px; }
  .thermal-comparison__column li b { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: var(--level); height: 5px; border-radius: 3px; }
  .thermal-comparison__column--before li b { background: #e35d5d; }
  .thermal-comparison__column--after li b { background: #1683e5; }
  .thermal-comparison__column li span, .thermal-comparison__column li strong { color: #071f3a; }
  .thermal-comparison__axis { display: grid; place-content: center; gap: 14px; border-right: 1px solid #d6e1ea; border-left: 1px solid #d6e1ea; background: #f4f8fb; color: #31506c; text-align: center; }
  .thermal-comparison__axis i { color: #1683e5; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .thermal-comparison__axis span { font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.6; }
  .thermal-comparison__shell > small { display: block; margin-top: 15px; color: #557086; line-height: 1.5; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .thermal-comparison__chart { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .thermal-comparison__axis { min-height: 82px; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #d6e1ea; border-bottom: 1px solid #d6e1ea; } .thermal-comparison__axis i { transform: rotate(90deg); } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .thermal-comparison__column { padding: 24px 20px; } .thermal-comparison__column > div { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 26px; } }
</style>
